                  <nc xml:id="m-8ff8e416-e9d0-4441-b1a0-4fb07222cd99" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-49aef704-671c-441d-b015-66e345788652" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-972fbb2f-81a2-43b2-9b6c-e4cb6cb66183" facs="#m-a28d389f-041d-4297-9bd7-9bfac98e359d" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-2768a357-f68d-4eae-b82e-1b5b0cb4d8ce"><lg xml:id="m-94b5f524-46e2-4390-9ab4-a67ecaf78fcd"><l xml:id="m-88fea3a0-c1f9-4984-925f-98525e5dd8d2" facs="#m-5cef500c-1ab4-43e2-a780-d0cb6cdf0351" label="ambiguous">1786</l><l xml:id="m-db094e34-d51e-47f4-88d4-f6d31e629563" facs="#m-06a6843e-833d-44d4-81ea-650776ec2e2c" label="text-like">omce for the Dead.</l><l xml:id="m-a7c53580-68b4-4eef-bdd8-460b3d1f7920" facs="#m-ca562edd-19ee-4c9e-8b30-6c47b001a7bb" label="lyrics-like">égo ipse, et non á-li¬ us, et ócu-li</l><l xml:id="m-681bae92-05c6-48ab-a13d-7e61f69eea6a" facs="#m-8ed7baf1-b1cb-4599-b3ca-560d99b43de4" label="lyrics-like">súrus sum:</l><l xml:id="m-d6592cdf-0fa9-4ea6-90cc-55bacaa52411" facs="#m-e66340b7-469c-419c-9e3d-2fbdda5b7b6f" label="lyrics-like">mé-i con-spectú-ri</l><l xml:id="m-8ffab449-1fb2-486f-9c6c-7a0fdb196680" facs="#m-97821863-1374-418b-b42d-a0ed971e9cea" label="lyrics-like">sunt. “ Et in cárne.</l><l xml:id="m-e0fc2c59-0a99-43b8-960c-dc1d655b09f3" facs="#m-180258be-a139-4770-a426-be58b0001d0f" label="ambiguous">Job 10, 1-7.</l><l xml:id="m-9f3c8918-b7a3-4d5d-bb63-3c339bd50c93" facs="#m-5f8446b0-2289-4211-9fb0-e0d0e2028483" label="ambiguous">Lesson II.</l><l xml:id="m-2750ff43-a346-46f4-8a2a-b7a313974997" facs="#m-e450df1c-710c-4dbd-b76d-2500ca1e84a9" label="lyrics-like">mAedet ánimam meam vitae! Numquid óculi cárnei tibi sunt:</l><l xml:id="m-a12e2fd7-7ec0-41a3-8e2d-be930f6cd24f" facs="#m-b260a445-8ece-4f84-86a5-170d579918b7" label="lyrics-like">aut sicut videt homo, et tu vidébis?</l><l xml:id="m-c5470801-beba-41a2-83e7-e89d2be323c7" facs="#m-08c9dccc-6230-42f6-b661-555cc4569ebf" label="lyrics-like">I meae, dimittam advérsum me</l><l xml:id="m-c3880a67-26df-4454-8aaa-ee9dd2ec9e71" facs="#m-0316daec-1240-4268-ad0e-96cf622c0a45" label="lyrics-like">Numquid sicut dies hóminis dies</l><l xml:id="m-91379d6a-d2b8-4a49-98b6-c84451cf2b6d" facs="#m-37287241-181d-4b16-9fe2-0eb04844cbe0" label="lyrics-like">elóquium meum, loquar in amari¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a9e6a17-8759-4578-aba8-2159e1f78dd9" facs="#m-977792ce-058d-4215-adbe-0d5ca86d4ebd" label="lyrics-like">túdine ánimae meae. Dicam Deo:</l><l xml:id="m-a986bffe-6ac0-4262-b6e9-2a9dd82a61fa" facs="#m-e0b94185-7bb3-40b4-b3b8-e5ef82baa5c3" label="lyrics-like">tui, et anni tui sicut humána</l><l xml:id="m-44433642-780d-4e81-a8d3-7452089d15b9" facs="#m-652664ba-4917-44d3-a79d-ad8967cfb690" label="lyrics-like">sunt témpora, ut quaeras iniqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-764ea436-1554-4d85-99b0-4f44be4a1214" facs="#m-f7ad6fe3-3c56-4df4-9d77-4fd7110ceb60" label="lyrics-like">Noli me condemnáre: indica mihi</l><l xml:id="m-69916212-2686-4237-b86a-ae73e17f0968" facs="#m-b41ea4b4-0f56-4c96-b882-f8f821574caa" label="lyrics-like">cur me ita júdices. Numquid bonum! tátem meam, et peccátum meum</l><l xml:id="m-4def24d9-b1f9-4204-b4dc-1b3a42e2568d" facs="#m-2f76ca1f-b3b7-4d36-adbc-e1ca34262763" label="lyrics-like">tibi vidétur, si calumniéris me et óp-scrutéris? Et scias quia nihil impium</l><l xml:id="m-63f2a67d-4b57-41d3-974f-bd86ebee3a64" facs="#m-be55cfb8-302a-45b3-a6e7-855005e0042e" label="lyrics-like">primas me, opus mánuum tuárum, ] fécerim, cum sit nemo qui de ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-11b188a8-f153-4cb4-9ac3-104a7fb8247e" facs="#m-900b9b0e-441e-46a7-bbee-d1ec5cb57a6b" label="lyrics-like">et consilium impiórum ádjuves?] nu tua possit erúere.</l><l xml:id="m-1c5e7d23-5a90-44f9-a834-710ad93abe04" facs="#m-395f3293-4855-4cb3-a3ab-fb58aadb7bbc" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-95215a78-312c-4519-b64c-449cbfd999ef" facs="#m-635dbc14-c663-45f2-befb-cfd82170d4b0" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-852b00dd-22f6-4c8a-a080-0c6915ec0f19" facs="#m-5ea381fa-e1a2-4325-a099-439086dfc9a2" label="lyrics-like">UI Lá¬ zarum</l><l xml:id="m-074e35e1-faa4-4248-a53c-583b81724d5f" facs="#m-b34eebb9-36bc-451d-933c-f658d54db35e" label="lyrics-like">*re-susci-tá-sti a monumén¬</l><l xml:id="m-27dc018c-9d10-4177-9e6c-96d08cd8758a" facs="#m-e888e862-6931-4237-abc2-6e24260e558e" label="lyrics-like">to foéti- dum:“Tu é- is, Dó-mi- ne, dóna ré¬</l><l xml:id="m-54218f20-4faf-4720-9a7a-87fb641db0ad" facs="#m-a73936d7-b32f-4ad8-8156-e4d63388b58f" label="lyrics-like">qui- em et ló-cum indul¬ génti- ae. V. Qui ventúrus</l><l xml:id="m-2fc0fb79-8b68-4a2a-b25c-a76f2a09a252" facs="#m-079797e5-d14f-40a7-8261-471389784637" label="lyrics-like">judi-cá-re ví-vos et mórtu¬s, et saécu¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d067561-634d-4eb4-97b6-34b0082a271a" facs="#m-9d70a76e-1d42-4b72-8c6d-ec102725040d" label="ambiguous">es</l><l xml:id="m-3f8e93d6-fe05-497a-8e6a-c00355fcaa55" facs="#m-344ed880-c53e-4d7b-9006-98193d229723" label="lyrics-like">lum per¬ -gnem. - Tu é-is.</l><l xml:id="m-1b1bf4bc-5bfa-4744-80ec-558ebe319551" facs="#m-d6e68430-4ec8-4b83-9828-d53e59c8f240" label="ambiguous">Lesson III.</l><l xml:id="m-d3c7fddc-a2c8-4f99-96fc-87a7f54f5d68" facs="#m-c70badbc-0f62-493b-9a7d-820178ad4417" label="ambiguous">Job 10, r8-12.</l><l xml:id="m-2c383393-9853-40ef-8fee-979811f6a76a" facs="#m-646802d6-c401-4229-9c57-1f38ee8ce511" label="lyrics-like">Anus tuae fecérunt me, et plas¬ sicut cáseum me coagulásti? Pelle et</l><l xml:id="m-3a0842f9-b0ff-4e56-9765-0e3ab6ab60cd" facs="#m-626fb133-325f-47f7-bff1-de32da2317b2" label="lyrics-like">A mavérunt me totum in circui-áibus vestisti me: óssibus et</l><l xml:id="m-1e49d722-80b5-46cf-9429-a392daf5910a" facs="#m-37b0001b-2b02-423e-9e34-088ce9803a0c" label="lyrics-like">tu : et sic repénte praecípitas me?</l><l xml:id="m-e6517cdb-e16b-4c82-8736-4994e0b8b4d4" facs="#m-bb90cd24-66ba-4ce7-b3b6-3ab3014b9bf5" label="lyrics-like">nervis compegísti me. Vitam et mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-87e40670-1220-42d4-b3a8-e6bc9966531b" facs="#m-8d07216b-45e9-4bab-819c-d7d0984b6977" label="lyrics-like">sericórdiam tribuisti mihi, et visi¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b40da13-026b-43a7-8d66-9fe4339f3329" facs="#m-6ccfb7f6-abd3-4840-a09a-53d137fcc44e" label="lyrics-like">Meménto, quaeso, quod sicut lutum</l><l xml:id="m-77d70949-409a-4882-af29-6d0390ffbdbf" facs="#m-9e144164-b160-4287-a2a2-ab3bec94eccf" label="lyrics-like">féceris me, et in púlverem redúces</l><l xml:id="m-d2be4be2-9d10-4a19-96a7-6af2a333f702" facs="#m-5cc2c0f2-7977-4c29-a9ab-708fa5ade6d2" label="lyrics-like">tátio tua custodivit spiritum meum.</l><l xml:id="m-6b81a38f-e722-4ac8-bb8f-d5a146b271f4" facs="#m-93bc42ac-f23d-445e-ae69-a8243e4824ba" label="lyrics-like">me. Nonne sicut lac mulsísti me, et</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>